e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9tWGK6DgPXsQ7kNvwEa2FVy&_nc_oc=AdpYSn9JcNmxLjggsFWl2FRPgZGamE7J4zJNM0P-v4BA3sPaxzOHoXsUgcUGiBRKtUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2_eiX61kZ5eb7wZiHYgv92E6xAzgMEIDNVevM_-L4n2g&oe=69E36639"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vbxeK6UqF7AQ7kNvwFaOo3f&_nc_oc=Adox4KMs2ei91ixosiU5QzgE-0JKS0nluMh3n9pnvUZZA91fYSKw1arPDnYs9Z_1zCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3i6emPXKUuy7gWtDB6uijfS7zZWWeib2bxoEwL_KYRQQ&oe=69E375D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k8vKGiUdnfwQ7kNvwF41Ob1&_nc_oc=Adqfb2O1dzgSHCOzaU4W76MuyjNFVpmHk28-VXsjfDTWuHtHLbybf22krxUqpPRzswg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af30Bs1n5HBHS3bB8KSnL4CHf80H32cfgoajwsUSplZFDw&oe=69E3817B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SS8x_9ctetYQ7kNvwE9-5EC&_nc_oc=AdrAkOQrxWS79Z5qSYLZRn1hxXtXnfBeUqbmI__pevWUjzqOxh0vHOohtIOyOli35M0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af19aQxfO5hyb_Hv1PVzPXoGC-WqvGWNZK6Eg4JM6480lw&oe=69E382CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A881a4RIuNkQ7kNvwHf_sdL&_nc_oc=AdpX-Z1ahNMr6vLmayUgA4kNGgU6q0MgbuLhb811qQvf03KclraKbnkGklgwHHTtc7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af35OTdPROhrOtyJ7whH2DGaGJ8aDOSWpkeaM-1670dloA&oe=69E36BFE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se